Name: codes
Version: 0.1.0
Summary: Utility classes and methods that I use across projects in my PhD, on using high-res geodetic data and probabilistic inversions to probe the damage zone around faults.
Requires-Python: >=3.9
Description-Content-Type: text/markdown
Requires-Dist: numpy>=2.0.2

This package contains codes that I use across various projects in my PhD, which is using high-resolution data (geodetic, seismic, etc) and probabilistic inversions to study the damage zone around faults.

Bundling these codes into a package is also an excuse for me to keep my code clean, modular, and well-documented!
